cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project or its model, please cite it as below."
title: "ZhenLM: a 140M bilingual language model trained from scratch on one 16GB GPU"
abstract: >-
  ZhenLM-140M is a Chinese-English 137.8M-parameter decoder-only language model
  trained from random initialization (3B-token pre-training, 250M-token SFT,
  LoRA ablations, GGUF/Ollama demo), on a single RTX 5070 Ti 16GB GPU. The
  repository includes the full data pipeline, training/evaluation
  scripts, evidence, and a detailed evaluation report covering contamination
  discovery, a 90-question holdout, a second review that did not reproduce
  the claimed improvement, quantization fidelity, and capability limits.
